00:02:28.747 --> 00:02:34.081
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:34.131 --> 00:02:35.281
Commute!

23
00:02:36.225 --> 00:02:46.549
Think and answer. Would you rather live in a city or the countryside? Why?

24
